    Heresy is a courier group that specializes in adding strength and
    organization to boards throughout the eastern united states. We are
    not here to compete with anyone else, just to trade and have fun.

    Group News: Heresy is still relatively new and looking for couriers  
                and site ops. If you are interested, contact a senior.  

    Group Greets:  RiSC, Malice, PWA, DOD, Rigid, and Pinnacle!


